"\n<header class=\"loan-header\"><div class=\"wrap header-inner\"><a href=\"#top\" aria-label=\"ClearPath Financial home\"><span class=\"wordmark\">ClearPath</span></a><nav aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"#benefits\">Personal loans</a><a href=\"#how-it-works\">How it works</a><a href=\"#faq\">FAQs</a></nav><button class=\"header-cta\" type=\"button\" data-apply>Check your rate <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button><button class=\"menu-button\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"Toggle navigation\"><span></span><span></span></button></div></header>\n<main id=\"top\"><section class=\"hero wrap\"><div class=\"hero-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Personal loans. Personal possibilities.</p><h1>Personal loans for what's next</h1><p class=\"hero-description\">Fixed rates from 5.99% to 35.99% APR. Loans from $2,000 to $50,000.</p><button class=\"button hero-button\" type=\"button\" data-apply>Check your rate <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button><p class=\"soft-check\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4 10-10\"/></svg><span>Checking your rate won't affect your credit score.</span></p></div><div class=\"hero-image\"><img src=\"assets/hero.jpg\" alt=\"Two fictional adults reviewing a laptop together in a bright contemporary home.\"><div class=\"photo-caption\"><span class=\"caption-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4 10-10\"/></svg></span><p>A little clarity.<br><strong>A lot of possibility.</strong></p></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"feature-strip\" id=\"benefits\"><div class=\"wrap feature-row\"><div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4 10-10\"/></svg><span>Fixed monthly payments</span></div><div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4 10-10\"/></svg><span>Funds as soon as the next business day</span></div><div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12 4 4 10-10\"/></svg><span>No prepayment fees</span></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"payment-section wrap\"><div class=\"payment-inner\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Give your budget some breathing room</span><h2>Lower your monthly payment</h2></div><p>Pay as little as <strong>$150/month.</strong></p><div class=\"payment-decoration\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"how-section wrap\" id=\"how-it-works\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">A clear path forward</p><h2>How it works</h2></div><p>From a first look to your next step,<br>know where you stand.</p></div><ol class=\"steps\"><li><span class=\"step-number\">01</span><h3>Check your rate</h3><p>Tell us a little about your plans and see the options available to you.</p></li><li><span class=\"step-number\">02</span><h3>Choose your loan</h3><p>Review your offer, choose an amount, and complete your application.</p></li><li><span class=\"step-number\">03</span><h3>Move forward</h3><p>After approval and verification, receive your funds and put your plan in motion.</p></li></ol></section>\n<section class=\"faq-section\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap faq-layout\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Good questions. Clear answers.</p><h2>A little more <br>peace of mind.</h2><p class=\"faq-intro\">Here's what to know as you explore your options.</p></div><div class=\"faq-list\"><details open><summary>What can I use a personal loan for?<span class=\"plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>You can use a personal loan to consolidate debt, make home improvements, cover a major expense, or fund another eligible personal purpose.</p></details><details open><summary>Will checking my rate affect my credit score?<span class=\"plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>Checking your rate uses a soft credit inquiry and won't affect your credit score. If you accept an offer and proceed with a full application, a hard credit inquiry may affect your score.</p></details><details open><summary>When could I receive my funds?<span class=\"plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>After approval and completion of required verification, funds may be available as soon as the next business day. Timing also depends on your bank and when you complete the process.</p></details><details open><summary>Can I pay my loan off early?<span class=\"plus\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><p>Yes. You can make extra payments or pay your loan off early with no prepayment fees.</p></details></div></div></section>\n<section class=\"closing wrap\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Your next step starts here</p><h2>Make room for what's next.</h2></div><button class=\"button\" type=\"button\" data-apply>Check your rate <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button></section>\n</main><footer class=\"loan-footer\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"footer-top\"><a href=\"#top\" aria-label=\"ClearPath Financial home\"><span class=\"wordmark\">ClearPath</span></a><p>A clearer way forward.</p></div><p class=\"loan-disclosure\">Your APR depends on credit and other factors. Not all applicants qualify. Loans made by ClearPath Financial, NMLS ID 2468101. Not available in all states.</p><address>ClearPath Financial, 100 Market Street, Suite 400, Wilmington, DE 19801</address><p class=\"copyright\">© 2026 ClearPath Financial. All rights reserved.</p></div></footer>\n<dialog class=\"rate-dialog\"><form method=\"dialog\"><button class=\"dialog-close\" aria-label=\"Close rate information\" value=\"close\">×</button><span class=\"wordmark\">ClearPath</span><h2>Your next step,<br>with a clear view.</h2><p>Explore the loan details before you apply.</p><dl><div><dt>Loan amounts</dt><dd>$2,000 to $50,000</dd></div><div><dt>Fixed APR range</dt><dd>5.99% to 35.99%</dd></div></dl><p class=\"dialog-note\">Checking your rate won't affect your credit score. Your APR depends on credit and other factors. Not all applicants qualify.</p><button class=\"button\" value=\"close\">Back to loan details <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"/></svg></button></form></dialog>\n"
